20 questions

  answered            15/20
  refused honestly     5/20
  correct of answered 14/15  93%
  correct of all      14/20  70%

Refused:
  How many customers are in the Midwest region?                no plan
  Which supplier has the most products?                        no plan
  How many order lines had a discount of 15 percent?           no plan
  Which region grew revenue most between 2023 and 2025?        no plan
  How many suppliers are based outside the United States?      no plan

Answered but wrong:
  What was Voss Industrial's revenue in 2025?                  metric=revenue

Every query that ran was built from a spec, so:
  statements produced: {'SELECT'}
  tables reachable:    {v_sales}
  There is no code path from a question to DELETE, DROP or a second table.

The refusals are the feature. A question the layer cannot express comes back as
a refusal rather than as a number that looks like every other number.
